        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DG425, 4 Inch Security Door Guard</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSecurity Door Guards are used on many hotel doors but work great for your home. The flip style 4 inch security door guard is easy to install and operate. It is packaged with matching finish screws and available in 9 great finishes. Manufactured by Deltana an architectural hardware leader with a proven record for exceptional service and quality. Deltana is the nation\u0019s most complete provider of solid brass door hardware. It is measures 4 inches by 2-1/2 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DG425.gif?v=1704354745\" width=\"600\" height=\"310\" border=\"0\" alt=\"4 Inch Security Door Guard Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Other Security Door Guards we have available:</b>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-5-inch-security-door-guard-deltana-dg525\">5 Inch Door Guard</a>\r\n<br> \r\n<a href=\"/products/door-security-chain-with-doorbolt-deltana-cdg35\">Chain Door Guard</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/contemporary-security-door-guard-with-ball-tension-action-deltana-dgsb675\">Contemporary Door Guard</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specification</b> of the Deltana DG425 Security Door Guard:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Guard Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Guard Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Guard Projection: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Guard Plate Length: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Guard Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Catch Length: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Catch Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Catch Plate Length: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Catch Plate Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish mounting screws</b>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DG425.pdf?v=1704262161\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DG425 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
