                "title": "Solid Brass 4 inch Security Door Guard, Deltana DG425",
                "description": "4 Inch Door Security Guard, Deltana DG425 - Security Door Guards are used on many hotel doors but work great for your home. The flip style 4 inch security door guard is easy to install and operate. It is packaged with matching finish screws and available in 9 great finishes. Manufactured by Deltana an architectural hardware leader with a proven record for exceptional service and quality. Deltana is the nation\u0019s most complete provider of solid brass door hardware. It is measures 4 inches by 2-1/2 inches.",
